ll not include a neighborhood procession associated with a block party.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"318948d1-63f6-5a8b-be76-0e4546b3b219"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.70.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.010","content_hash":"9ca8f0f2b2cfa0f3fae1c4eb02f7b5645023c18bd23de65fd4c821ad7ac717ad","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.010:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.010","text":"“Person” means a natural person or legal entity such as but not limited to an individual, firm, corporation, association, partnership or limited liability company.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"736427cd-c453-5fb1-aee0-dcae8d824e39"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.70.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.010","content_hash":"d22e3bb341f447efa3daafcbf54247d448bb66e69634a0757c3e8768c03d96e4","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.010:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.010","text":"“Police escort” means the assignment of law enforcement officers to provide a visibly authorized presence for public safety, traffic control, or to facilitate the movement of specific vehicles or individuals.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"307445cc-68c7-5f6a-a6f7-4ac867159dd0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.70.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.010","content_hash":"1cbefa12b5bf2471dc2d047769e61af78bf4be849ae29fc0598426c084b750b2","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-c